# yt - YouTube & YouTube Music search & player from terminal
# Uses yt-dlp + fzf + mpv
#
# Features:
#   - Search YouTube and YouTube Music (Songs, Albums, Playlists)
#   - Interactive full controls (seek, volume, next/prev track, speed, switch search mode)
#   - Search history (recent searches)
#   - Playlist & Album support (browse & play whole albums or tracks)
#   - Batch download with configurable formats
#   - Audio-only mode
#   - Event logging

